# Every variable in simple context, in every area, with at least two versions (one or two conditions). Openers (@open) come before her first line in every area, tails (@tail) after the last reaction of an exchange that went well, @meopen before your line, and move.* gives an option a label from the moment (only where the line has no hook of its own).

@rule open.ctx.favor.high
on @open
when favor>=80
- [Ah, it's you. Good.|Oh, you! Perfect timing.|Mm, I was hoping you'd stop by.]
- [You always cheer me up, you know.|Hi! You came at the right moment.]

@rule open.ctx.favor.low
on @open
when favor<=20
- [...Oh. You.|Hm. What is it?|...Yes?]
- [Make it quick.|...Fine. I'm listening.]

@rule open.ctx.lewd.high
on @open
when lewd>=60
- [Mm~ Hi there.|Oh, it's you~ Hello.|Hey... come a little closer.]
- [You've got that look again. Hehe.|My, my. Hello.]

@rule open.ctx.mood.cheerful
on @open
when mood=cheerful
- [Hehe, hi!|Oh, good timing!|Today's a good day, you know.]
- [I'm in a great mood, so ask me anything.|Hi! Everything's going right today.]

@rule open.ctx.mood.hungry
on @open
when mood=hungry
- [Sorry, my stomach's growling.|Ugh, I'm starving.|Excuse me, I haven't eaten.]
- [Talk fast, I need food.|Mm, I can smell the cafeteria from here.]

@rule open.ctx.mood.bored
on @open
when mood=bored
- [Finally, something to do.|Oh, thank goodness, a person.|I was dying of boredom.]
- [Rescue me from this day.|You're the most interesting thing that's happened all day.]

@rule open.ctx.mood.stressed
on @open
when mood=stressed
- [Sorry, I'm a little frazzled.|Ah, sorry, my head's everywhere.|Hah... okay. Hi.]
- [I have a million things to do, but okay.|Give me a second to breathe.]

@rule open.ctx.mood.lonely
on @open
when mood=lonely
- [Oh... hi. I'm glad you're here.|You came over. Thank you.|Ah, a friendly face.]
- [I haven't talked to anyone all day.|Stay a little, okay?]

@rule open.ctx.mood.flirty
on @open
when mood=flirty
- [Oh, hello there.|Hey, you~|Mm, look who it is.]
- [You look good today, you know.|I was just thinking about you. Funny.]

@rule open.ctx.mood.sleepy
on @open
when mood=sleepy
- [*yawn* Sorry.|Mm... hi.|Ah, sorry, I'm half asleep.]
- [Don't mind me if I nod off.|I barely slept, so be gentle.]

@rule open.ctx.mood.upset
on @open
when mood=upset
- [...Hi.|Sorry, I'm not in a great mood.|Hm.]
- [Don't take it personally if I'm short.|It's been a day.]

@rule open.ctx.period.lunch
on @open
when period=lunch
- [Mm, lunch break at last.|Ah, finally a break.|Lunchtime is the best time.]
- [I only have a few minutes before class.|Let me finish this bite.]

@rule open.ctx.period.after
on @open
when period=after
- [Ah, school's finally over.|Phew, the day's done.|Hey, you're still here?]
- [I should be heading home, but okay.|The hallways are so quiet after class.]

@rule open.ctx.period.club
on @open
when period=club
- [Oh, hey, during club time?|Ah, I'm supposed to be at club.]
- [Just a minute, then I have to go.|Club can wait a little.]

@rule open.ctx.place.library
on @open
when placeid=library
- [Shh, we're in the library.|Psst. Quietly.]
- [Keep your voice down, okay?|The librarian is watching us.]

@rule open.ctx.place.rooftop
on @open
when placeid=rooftop
- [The wind up here is nice.|Ah, the rooftop. I love it here.]
- [You can see the whole town from here.|Hold on, my hair is everywhere.]

@rule open.ctx.place.cafeteria
on @open
when placeid=cafeteria
- [It's so loud in here.|Mm, smells like curry today.]
- [Sorry, it's hard to hear in here.|Let me just put my tray down.]

@rule open.ctx.place.gym
on @open
when placeid=gym|field|pool
- [Phew, give me a second.|Ah, sorry, I'm all sweaty.]
- [Let me catch my breath.|Hah... okay. Hi.]

@rule open.ctx.place.infirmary
on @open
when placeid=infirmary
- [Shh, someone's resting.|Ah, the infirmary smells like medicine.]
- [Let's keep it down.|It's so quiet in here.]

@rule open.ctx.place.classroom
on @open
when placeid=classroom
- [Oh, hey. Class is over?|Ah, the classroom's empty now.]
- [I was just packing up.|Everyone left so fast.]

@rule open.ctx.weather.storm
on @open
when weather=storm
- [Whoa, did you hear that thunder?|Ugh, this storm.]
- [I hope it stops before I go home.|The windows keep rattling.]

@rule open.ctx.weather.clear
on @open
when weather=clear outside=yes
- [What a nice day.|The sun feels so good.]
- [It's too nice to be inside.|I could stay out here all day.]

@rule open.ctx.rainlater
on @open
when rainlater=yes
- [It looks like it's going to rain.|Those clouds look heavy.]
- [I hope I brought my umbrella.|It's going to pour later, isn't it?]

@rule open.ctx.outside
on @open
when outside=yes
- [Mm, fresh air.|It's nice to be outside.]
- [Way better than the classroom.|I like talking out here.]

@rule open.ctx.rainlover
on @open
when rainlover=yes wet=yes
- [I love this rain.|Listen to that rain. Isn't it nice?]
- [Rain makes everything quieter.|Don't tell anyone, but I love days like this.]

@rule open.ctx.voice.gyaru
on @open
when voice=gyaru
- [Omg, hiii.|Heyyy.|Okay, so.]
- [Like, literally, listen.|No but seriously.]

@rule open.ctx.voice.chuuni
on @open
when voice=chuuni
- [Ah, mortal, you appear.|Hmph. Our fates cross again.]
- [The stars foretold this meeting.|My left eye sensed your approach.]

@rule open.ctx.voice.lazy
on @open
when voice=lazy
- [Mm... hey.|Ugh, moving is hard. Hi.]
- [Can we talk sitting down?|I'm conserving energy.]

@rule open.ctx.voice.ojou
on @open
when voice=ojou
- [Oh-ho, it's you.|My, how unexpected.]
- [You may speak.|I suppose I have a moment for you.]

@rule open.ctx.tone.shy
on @open
when tone=shy
- [U-um...|Ah, h-hi...|Oh! S-sorry, you surprised me.]
- [I-I wasn't expecting you.|Um, h-hello...]

@rule open.ctx.tone.proper
on @open
when tone=proper
- [Good day.|Ah, hello. A pleasure, as always.|Oh, good timing.]
- [Please, go ahead.|I'm glad you came by.]

@rule open.ctx.warm
on @open
when warm>=0.75
- [Oh, hi! It's so nice to see you.|Hello, you.]
- [How are you holding up?|Come, sit with me.]

@rule open.ctx.warm.low
on @open
when warm<=0.3
- [What.|...Hm.]
- [Say it.|I'm busy, but go on.]

@rule open.ctx.energy.high
on @open
when energy>=0.8
- [Hey hey hey!|Oh! Oh! It's you!]
- [I've got so much energy today!|Okay, okay, okay!]

@rule open.ctx.energy.low
on @open
when energy<=0.25
- [Mm.|...Oh, hey.]
- [Sorry, I'm slow today.|Let me sit down first.]

@rule open.ctx.tease
on @open
when tease>=0.75
- [Oh? Look who it is.|Well, well.]
- [Come to bother me again?|You're so predictable.]

@rule open.ctx.shy
on @open
when shy>=0.75
- [Ah... um.|O-oh.]
- [I-I'm not good at this.|Sorry, I get nervous.]

@rule open.ctx.blunt
on @open
when blunt>=0.75
- [Okay. What.|Yeah?]
- [I'll be honest with you.|Let's skip the small talk.]

@rule open.ctx.profile.reserved
on @open
when profile=reserved
- [...Oh. Hello.|Ah. Hi.]
- [I'm not much of a talker.|Sorry, I'm quiet.]

@rule open.ctx.profile.open
on @open
when profile=open
- [Oh hey! Sit, sit!|Hiii! I was hoping someone would come by.]
- [I'll talk your ear off, I warn you.|Okay, I've got stories.]

@rule open.ctx.sign
on @open
when sign=*
- [My horoscope said I'd meet someone today.|The stars are on my side today, apparently.|My sign is supposed to be lucky this week.]
- [My horoscope told me to be honest today, so...|Typical me, according to my horoscope.]

@rule open.ctx.birthday.today
on @open
when birthday=today
- [Guess what day it is!|Today's my day, you know.]
- [It's my birthday, so be nice.|Hehe, I'm a year older today.]

@rule open.ctx.birthday.week
on @open
when birthday=week|soon
- [My birthday's coming up, did you know?|Ah, it's almost my birthday.]
- [Not that I'm counting the days.|Just saying.]

@rule open.ctx.height.tall
on @open
when height=tall
- [Ah, sorry, let me bend down.|Up here.]
- [I always have to look down at people.|Mind the door frame. Kidding.]

@rule open.ctx.height.short
on @open
when height=short
- [Hey, down here!|Ugh, everyone's so tall.]
- [Don't pat my head.|I'm standing on my toes, by the way.]

@rule open.ctx.bust.big
on @open
when bust=big lewd>=30
- [Ugh, this uniform is tight today.|Sorry, let me fix my blouse.]
- [These buttons are going to give up someday.|Don't stare, okay?]

@rule open.ctx.bust.small
on @open
when bust=small lewd>=30
- [Hmph. Hi.|Ah, hello.]
- [Don't look at me like that.|I know what you're thinking. Stop.]

@rule open.ctx.interest
on @open
when interest=yes
- [Oh! H-hi.|Ah, you came to see me?]
- [I was just thinking about you. Coincidence.|You always find me, huh?]

@rule open.ctx.clubkind.sports
on @open
when clubkind=sports
- [Phew, practice was rough.|My legs are still sore.]
- [I've been running all day.|Coach worked us hard.]

@rule open.ctx.clubkind.culture
on @open
when clubkind=culture
- [Ah, I just came from the club room.|Mm, sorry, my hands are full of club stuff.]
- [The club's been busy lately.|We have a project going.]

@rule open.ctx.kclub
on @open
when kclub=yes
- [Ah, my fellow club member.|Oh, the club president himself.]
- [Anything for the club today?|The Koikatsu Club never rests.]

@rule open.ctx.hasclub
on @open
when hasclub=yes
- [I was on my way to the {club}.|Ah, the {club} can wait a bit.]
- [The {club} keeps me busy.|Everyone at the {club} says hi. Probably.]

@rule open.ctx.exam
on @open
when exam=yes
- [Ugh, exams.|Sorry, my head is full of formulas.]
- [I should be studying right now.|Just one minute, then back to the books.]

@rule open.ctx.fight
on @open
when fight=yes
- [Sorry, I'm still upset about {fightwho}.|Ah... don't mention {fightwho}, okay?]
- [Things with {fightwho} are weird right now.|I'm a little on edge today.]

@rule open.ctx.rivalnear
on @open
when rivalnear=*
- [Ugh, {rivalnear} is here.|Let's talk quietly. {rivalnear} is nearby.]
- [Don't look, but {rivalnear} is staring.|Of all people, {rivalnear} is here.]

@rule open.ctx.bff
on @open
when bff=*
- [{bff} just left, you missed her.|Oh, I thought you were {bff}.]
- [{bff} says hi. Probably.|I was just texting {bff}.]

@rule open.ctx.partner
on @open
when partner=*
- [I was just with {partner}.|Ah, {partner} went to buy drinks.]
- [{partner} will be back soon.|Don't tell {partner} I said this.]

@rule open.ctx.days.many
on @open
when days=many
- [You again! Hehe.|Our daily chat, huh?]
- [I've gotten used to you coming by.|It wouldn't feel like a day without this.]

@rule open.ctx.days.few
on @open
when days=few rel!=stranger
- [Oh, hi. We don't talk much, huh?|Ah, hello.]
- [It's nice to talk for once.|I don't think we've chatted much.]

@rule open.ctx.club
on @open
when club=* hasclub=yes
- [The {club} has a meeting later.|Ah, sorry, {club} stuff on my mind.]
- [Have you ever visited the {club}?|The {club} is my second home.]

@rule open.ctx.rel.stranger.new
on @open
when rel=stranger tone=shy|proper
- [Oh, um, hello.|Ah, good day.]
- [I don't think we've met.|Pardon me, have we met?]

@rule open.ctx.role.story
on @open
when role=story|exstory
- [Ah, it's you.|Hey.]
- [It's been a while since we really talked.|You know me better than most.]

@rule open.ctx.verb.romance
on @open
when verb=kissed|had_h|dated|flirted
- [About that...|Ahem. So.|Mm, about the other day...]
- [My face is already hot.|Don't look at me like that.]

@rule open.ctx.verb.conflict
on @open
when verb=fought|insulted|cheated|broke_promise
- [Okay, about that...|Let's talk about it.]
- [I've been thinking about it.|It's been bothering me.]

@rule open.ctx.how.witness
on @open
when how=witness
- [I saw it, you know.|I was there.]
- [With my own eyes.|I'm not making this up.]

@rule open.ctx.how.heard
on @open
when how=heard|rumor
- [I heard something.|People are talking.]
- [I don't know if it's true.|Someone told me.]

@rule open.ctx.deed
on @open
when deed=*
- [About what happened...|So, that thing...]
- [I keep thinking about it.|I wanted to ask you.]

@rule open.ctx.valence.good
on @open
when valence>=1
- [Hehe, about that...|Ah, I wanted to say something nice.]
- [It made me happy.|I still smile about it.]

@rule open.ctx.valence.bad
on @open
when valence<=-1
- [I need to say something.|Listen.]
- [It's not easy to say.|I'm not happy about it.]

@rule open.ctx.weight
on @open
when weight>=2
- [This is serious.|I've been thinking about this a lot.]
- [I couldn't sleep over it.|It's a big deal to me.]

@rule open.ctx.distorted
on @open
when distorted=yes
- [I heard a version of this...|The story I heard was wild.]
- [It's probably exaggerated.|People change things when they tell them.]

@rule open.ctx.exposure.secret
on @open
when exposure=secret
- [Keep this between us.|Not so loud.]
- [Nobody else knows, right?|This stays here.]

@rule open.ctx.exposure.rumored
on @open
when exposure=rumored|known
- [Everyone's talking about it.|You know what people are saying?]
- [The whole class knows.|It's all over the school.]

@rule open.ctx.subj.player
on @open
when subj=player
- [So, you.|About what you did...]
- [I have to ask you about it.|You know what I mean.]

@rule open.ctx.obj.her
on @open
when obj=her
- [About what happened to me...|You know what happened, right?]
- [I still feel it.|It was about me, after all.]

@rule open.ctx.aboutplayer
on @open
when aboutplayer=yes
- [It's about you, you know.|It's about you.]
- [Don't pretend you don't know.|I heard your name in it.]

@rule open.ctx.who
on @open
when who=*
- [About {who}...|So, {who}.]
- [{who}, of all people.|You know {who}, right?]

@rule open.ctx.whorel.friend
on @open
when whorel=friend
- [It's about my friend.|{who} is my friend, so...]
- [I care about her.|I'm on her side, you know.]

@rule open.ctx.whorel.rival
on @open
when whorel=rival
- [Ugh. {who}.|Of course it's {who}.]
- [I don't like her, I'll say it.|Typical {who}.]

@rule open.ctx.whorel.crush
on @open
when whorel=crush
- [Um. About {who}...|Ah... {who}.]
- [Don't read too much into how I say her name.|She's... important to me.]

@rule open.ctx.src
on @open
when src=*
- [{src} told me.|I heard it from {src}.]
- [{src} wouldn't lie about this.|Don't tell {src} I told you.]

@rule open.ctx.speed
on @open
when speed=same_day|fast
- [That was fast, wasn't it?|Things moved quickly, huh?]
- [Everyone noticed how fast.|I'm still catching up.]

@rule open.ctx.romance
on @open
when romance=yes
- [This is about love stuff, isn't it.|Ah, romance talk.]
- [My heart's not ready.|Hehe, I love this kind of story.]

@rule open.ctx.public.no
on @open
when public=no
- [Somewhere private, huh.|Behind closed doors, I heard.]
- [Nobody was supposed to see.|Not exactly in public.]

@rule open.ctx.opinion.good
on @open
when opinion>=1
- [Honestly? I think it's nice.|I don't mind it at all.]
- [Good for you, really.|I'm happy about it.]

@rule open.ctx.opinion.bad
on @open
when opinion<=-1
- [Honestly? I don't like it.|I'll be frank.]
- [I'm not okay with it.|It bothers me.]

@rule open.ctx.fplace
on @open
when fplace=*
- [At the {fplace}, of all places.|In the {fplace}, right?]
- [I can't stop picturing the {fplace}.|The {fplace}...]

@rule open.ctx.since
on @open
when since<=2
- [So soon after...|Right after, huh?]
- [It hasn't even been long.|That quick.]

@rule tail.ctx.favor.high
on @tail
when favor>=80
- [I like talking with you.|You're easy to talk to.|This was nice.]
- [Come find me again, okay?|Let's do this more.]

@rule tail.ctx.favor.low
on @tail
when favor<=20
- [...That's all.|Anyway.]
- [Don't get the wrong idea.|We're done here.]

@rule tail.ctx.tone.gentle
on @tail
when tone=gentle
- [Thank you for listening.|Hehe, I'm glad.]
- [You're kind, you know.|That made me happy.]

@rule tail.ctx.tone.energetic
on @tail
when tone=energetic
- [Okay, I feel great now!|Yes! Let's go!]
- [Hehe, you're fun!|That was awesome!]

@rule tail.ctx.tone.cool
on @tail
when tone=cool
- [...Not bad.|Fine.]
- [I'll remember that.|Good talk. I mean it.]

@rule tail.ctx.tone.teasing
on @tail
when tone=teasing
- [You're cute when you try~|Hehe, gotcha.]
- [I'll let you off easy this time~|Don't get cocky.]

@rule tail.ctx.tone.shy
on @tail
when tone=shy
- [Th-thank you for talking to me...|Um... that was nice.]
- [S-sorry if I was weird.|I-I liked that.]

@rule tail.ctx.tone.proper
on @tail
when tone=proper
- [Thank you. A pleasant talk.|I enjoyed that, truly.]
- [Let's speak again soon.|You have my gratitude.]

@rule tail.ctx.warm
on @tail
when warm>=0.75
- [Take care of yourself, okay?|I'm glad you're here.]
- [Don't push yourself too hard.|You can always talk to me.]

@rule tail.ctx.warm.low
on @tail
when warm<=0.3
- [Whatever.|Hm. Okay.]
- [That's enough chatting.|Don't make it a habit.]

@rule tail.ctx.energy.high
on @tail
when energy>=0.8
- [Okay, I'm pumped!|Let's do something fun next!]
- [I could talk all day!|Woo!]

@rule tail.ctx.energy.low
on @tail
when energy<=0.25
- [Mm... that was nice.|I'm tired, but that was nice.]
- [I need a nap now.|Okay... good.]

@rule tail.ctx.tease
on @tail
when tease>=0.75
- [You're too easy to tease.|Hehe, your face.]
- [I'll get you next time.|That was fun. For me.]

@rule tail.ctx.shy
on @tail
when shy>=0.75
- [...I talked a lot, huh.|Ah... sorry, I'm blushing.]
- [Don't look at me.|That was embarrassing. Nice, though.]

@rule tail.ctx.blunt
on @tail
when blunt>=0.75
- [That's my honest opinion.|Take it or leave it.]
- [I don't sugarcoat things.|Anyway, that's that.]

@rule tail.ctx.kclub
on @tail
when kclub=yes
- [See you at the club.|The club room later, right?]
- [Don't skip the club today.|Club president's orders. Kidding.]

@rule tail.ctx.exam
on @tail
when exam=yes
- [Okay, back to studying.|Now I really have to study.]
- [Good luck on the exams.|Let's both pass, okay?]

@rule tail.ctx.rivalnear
on @tail
when rivalnear=*
- [And {rivalnear} can mind her own business.|Let's go before {rivalnear} comes over.]
- [{rivalnear} is still glaring.|Ignore {rivalnear}.]

@rule tail.ctx.lewd.high
on @tail
when lewd>=60
- [Hehe... you're thinking something, aren't you?|Mm, careful, I might get ideas.]
- [Later, maybe~|Don't look at me like that. Or do.]

@rule tail.ctx.interest
on @tail
when interest=yes
- [I like this... talking with you.|I'm happy you came.]
- [Stay a little longer?|My heart's going fast. Ignore it.]

@rule tail.ctx.mood.cheerful
on @tail
when mood=cheerful
- [What a good day!|Hehe, today's the best.]
- [Everything's going right.|I'm so happy today.]

@rule tail.ctx.mood.sleepy
on @tail
when mood=sleepy
- [*yawn* Sorry.|I need a nap.]
- [I'm so sleepy...|Wake me up next period.]

@rule tail.ctx.verb.romance
on @tail
when verb=kissed|had_h|dated|flirted
- [...Let's not tell anyone.|Hehe... my face is still hot.]
- [I still think about it.|Don't make me remember it in class.]

@rule tail.ctx.verb.conflict
on @tail
when verb=fought|insulted|cheated|broke_promise
- [Let's put it behind us.|I feel better now.]
- [Thanks for talking about it.|It's okay now. Mostly.]

@rule tail.ctx.fplace
on @tail
when fplace=*
- [I won't look at the {fplace} the same way.|Not the {fplace} again, okay?]
- [The {fplace}, honestly...|Let's avoid the {fplace} for a while.]

@rule tail.ctx.public.no
on @tail
when public=no
- [At least nobody saw. Probably.|Keep it private, okay?]
- [Behind closed doors stays there.|Let's be careful next time.]

@rule tail.ctx.valence.good
on @tail
when valence>=1
- [That really made me happy.|I'll remember it.]
- [Thank you for that, really.|It was a good day.]

@rule tail.ctx.valence.bad
on @tail
when valence<=-1
- [It still stings a little.|Let's not do that again.]
- [I'm okay. Really.|We'll get past it.]

@rule tail.ctx.weight
on @tail
when weight>=2
- [That was a big thing, you know.|I'm glad we talked about it.]
- [I needed to say that.|It was weighing on me.]

@rule tail.ctx.opinion.good
on @tail
when opinion>=1
- [I'm happy for you. Really.|That's a nice thing.]
- [It suits you.|Good. I mean it.]

@rule tail.ctx.opinion.bad
on @tail
when opinion<=-1
- [I still don't like it.|Just so you know where I stand.]
- [Think about it, okay?|I won't say more.]

@rule tail.ctx.distorted
on @tail
when distorted=yes
- [I guess people exaggerate.|So the rumor was wrong. Good.]
- [I'll correct the others.|People love to change stories.]

@rule tail.ctx.exposure.secret
on @tail
when exposure=secret
- [Our secret, okay?|Not a word to anyone.]
- [I'll keep it to myself.|This never happened. Got it?]

@rule tail.ctx.exposure.rumored
on @tail
when exposure=rumored|known
- [Let people talk.|They'll forget about it soon.]
- [The rumors will die down.|Everyone has something to say, huh.]

@rule tail.ctx.subj.player
on @tail
when subj=player
- [You're something else, you know.|That's so like you.]
- [Just be careful.|I'm watching you. Hehe.]

@rule tail.ctx.obj.her
on @tail
when obj=her
- [Thanks for caring about me.|It means a lot that you asked.]
- [I'm okay now.|I'll be fine.]

@rule tail.ctx.aboutplayer
on @tail
when aboutplayer=yes
- [You're always in the middle of things.|You and your stories.]
- [Try to stay out of trouble.|What will you do next, I wonder.]

@rule tail.ctx.whorel
on @tail
when whorel=friend|rival|crush
- [Don't tell {who} I said that.|{who} doesn't need to know.]
- [This stays between us and away from {who}.|Not a word to {who}.]

@rule tail.ctx.speed
on @tail
when speed=same_day|fast
- [Next time, slow down a little.|Things move fast with you.]
- [I can barely keep up with you.|So fast...]

@rule tail.ctx.romance
on @tail
when romance=yes
- [Love is complicated, huh.|Hehe, romance.]
- [My heart can't take these stories.|So sweet.]

@rule tail.ctx.since
on @tail
when since<=2
- [It was only a few days ago, huh.|Feels like yesterday.]
- [So recent...|Still fresh.]

@rule tail.ctx.exposure.who
on @tail
when who=* src=*
- [I'll have a word with {src}.|And {src} talks too much.]
- [Next time I'll ask {who} myself.|{src} will hear from me.]

@rule tail.ctx.how
on @tail
when how=witness|heard|rumor
- [I'm glad I asked you.|Better to hear it from you.]
- [Now I know the real story.|Good. I was wondering.]

@rule meopen.ctx.favor.high
on @meopen
when favor>=80
- [Hey, you.|Hey, there you are.]
- [I was hoping to see you.|Glad I found you.]

@rule meopen.ctx.favor.low
on @meopen
when favor<=20
- [Uh, hi.|Sorry to bother you, but...]
- [I know you're busy, but...|Just a second.]

@rule meopen.ctx.lewd.high
on @meopen
when lewd>=60
- [Hey, cutie.|Hey, you look good today.]
- [You're glowing today.|Is it hot in here, or...?]

@rule meopen.ctx.mood.sleepy
on @meopen
when mood=sleepy
- [You look tired.|Hey, sleepyhead.]
- [I'll keep it short so you can rest.|Don't fall asleep on me.]

@rule meopen.ctx.mood.upset
on @meopen
when mood=upset|stressed
- [Hey, deep breath.|You look like you need a break.]
- [I'll try to take your mind off things.|Whoa, hey, easy.]

@rule meopen.ctx.mood.cheerful
on @meopen
when mood=cheerful
- [You look happy.|Someone's in a good mood.]
- [Nice smile today.|Your smile's contagious.]

@rule meopen.ctx.mood.hungry
on @meopen
when mood=hungry
- [You look like you need food.|Was that your stomach?]
- [I'll be quick, then go eat.|Quick, before you faint from hunger.]

@rule meopen.ctx.mood.lonely
on @meopen
when mood=lonely|bored
- [Hey, got a minute?|Mind if I keep you company?]
- [You looked like you needed someone to talk to.|Can I sit here?]

@rule meopen.ctx.period.lunch
on @meopen
when period=lunch
- [Hey, lunch break.|Got a minute before the bell?]
- [Before lunch ends...|Quick question while we eat.]

@rule meopen.ctx.period.after
on @meopen
when period=after
- [Hey, before you head home...|School's out, so...]
- [Before you go...|Wait up a second.]

@rule meopen.ctx.place.library
on @meopen
when placeid=library
- [Psst.|Hey, quietly...]
- [Sorry, in the library and all, but...|Whispering, okay?]

@rule meopen.ctx.place.rooftop
on @meopen
when placeid=rooftop|courtyard|field|park
- [Nice view, huh?|Great spot.]
- [It's nice out here.|Good place to talk.]

@rule meopen.ctx.outside
on @meopen
when outside=yes
- [Nice out, huh?|Fresh air's nice.]
- [Glad we're outside.|Better than the classroom.]

@rule meopen.ctx.rainlover
on @meopen
when rainlover=yes wet=yes
- [You look happy about the rain.|Perfect weather for you.]
- [Rain suits you.|I knew you'd be smiling today.]

@rule meopen.ctx.voice.chuuni
on @meopen
when voice=chuuni
- [Greetings, dark one.|Hey, the stars sent me.]
- [Is your left eye behaving today?|O mighty one...]

@rule meopen.ctx.voice.gyaru
on @meopen
when voice=gyaru|genki
- [Hey hey!|Yo!]
- [What's up?|Okay, listen.]

@rule meopen.ctx.tone.shy
on @meopen
when tone=shy
- [Hey, it's just me.|Don't worry, it's me.]
- [Sorry, did I startle you?|Hi, I'll be quick.]

@rule meopen.ctx.tone.proper
on @meopen
when tone=proper
- [Good afternoon.|Excuse me.]
- [If you have a moment...|Pardon the interruption.]

@rule meopen.ctx.tone.teasing
on @meopen
when tone=teasing
- [Okay, no teasing this time.|Before you start making fun of me...]
- [Be nice.|Don't laugh, okay?]

@rule meopen.ctx.warm
on @meopen
when warm>=0.75
- [Hey, thanks for always being nice to me.|Hey, you.]
- [You're always so kind, so...|Can I ask you something?]

@rule meopen.ctx.energy.high
on @meopen
when energy>=0.8
- [Whoa, slow down a second.|You're full of energy today.]
- [Hold still a second.|You've got energy to spare.]

@rule meopen.ctx.energy.low
on @meopen
when energy<=0.25
- [Don't get up.|Hey, stay comfy.]
- [Relax, it's just me.|No rush.]

@rule meopen.ctx.tease
on @meopen
when tease>=0.75
- [Before you say anything...|No jokes, okay?]
- [Promise you won't laugh.|Go easy on me.]

@rule meopen.ctx.shy
on @meopen
when shy>=0.75
- [Hey, it's okay.|No pressure, but...]
- [Take your time.|It's just me, relax.]

@rule meopen.ctx.blunt
on @meopen
when blunt>=0.75
- [Honest answer, please.|Give it to me straight.]
- [No sugarcoating.|Be honest.]

@rule meopen.ctx.profile.reserved
on @meopen
when profile=reserved
- [Sorry to interrupt.|Hey, mind if I talk to you?]
- [I'll be quick.|Just a second of your time.]

@rule meopen.ctx.profile.open
on @meopen
when profile=open
- [Okay, I've got one for you.|Hey, guess what.]
- [Story time?|You'll like this.]

@rule meopen.ctx.sign
on @meopen
when sign=*
- [The stars sent me your way.|My horoscope said to talk to you.]
- [Lucky day for me, finding you.|My horoscope said today's a good day to talk.]

@rule meopen.ctx.birthday
on @meopen
when birthday=today|week|soon
- [Birthday girl!|Hey, it's almost your day.]
- [Happy almost-birthday, by the way.|Hey, birthday girl.]

@rule meopen.ctx.height.tall
on @meopen
when height=tall
- [Hey, up there.|Hey, tall one.]
- [Can you hear me from up there?|Don't step on me.]

@rule meopen.ctx.height.short
on @meopen
when height=short
- [Hey, down there. Kidding!|Hey, small fry. Sorry!]
- [Found you. You're hard to spot.|Hey, there you are.]

@rule meopen.ctx.bust
on @meopen
when bust=big|small lewd>=40
- [Eyes up. Mine, I mean. Hi.|Hey, nice uniform today.]
- [Nice ribbon, by the way.|You look nice today.]

@rule meopen.ctx.interest
on @meopen
when interest=yes
- [Hey... I was looking for you.|Hey, you.]
- [I wanted to see you.|There you are.]

@rule meopen.ctx.clubkind.sports
on @meopen
when clubkind=sports
- [Hey, champ.|Hey, star athlete.]
- [You look strong today.|Don't let me keep you from training.]

@rule meopen.ctx.clubkind.culture
on @meopen
when clubkind=culture
- [Don't let me keep you from the club.|Taking a club break?]
- [I won't keep you long.|You always look busy.]

@rule meopen.ctx.hasclub
on @meopen
when hasclub=yes
- [Before you go to the {club}...|Hey, {club} member.]
- [Quick, before club.|The {club} can spare you a minute.]

@rule meopen.ctx.exam
on @meopen
when exam=yes
- [Taking a study break?|Hey, bookworm.]
- [Exams are killing me too.|Quick break from the books.]

@rule meopen.ctx.fight
on @meopen
when fight=yes
- [I won't bring up {fightwho}. Promise.|Hey, forget about {fightwho} for a second.]
- [Something else, to take your mind off it.|Let's talk about anything but that.]

@rule meopen.ctx.rivalnear
on @meopen
when rivalnear=*
- [Ignore {rivalnear}.|Don't mind {rivalnear}.]
- [Over here, away from {rivalnear}.|Let's talk somewhere else.]

@rule meopen.ctx.partner
on @meopen
when partner=*
- [No {partner} around, huh.|Just you today, no {partner}.]
- [Say hi to {partner} for me.|I'll steal you from {partner} for a second.]

@rule meopen.ctx.days.many
on @meopen
when days=many
- [Me again.|Our usual chat.]
- [You knew I'd come.|Same time as always.]

@rule meopen.ctx.days.few
on @meopen
when days=few rel!=stranger
- [Hey, we don't talk enough.|Hi. Long time, huh?]
- [I've been meaning to talk to you.|It's been a while.]

@rule move.invite.ctx.period.lunch
on move.invite
when period=lunch
- Ask her to eat lunch together
- Offer to share your lunch

@rule move.invite.ctx.period.after
on move.invite
when period=after
- Ask her to walk home together
- Ask if she wants to hang out after school

@rule move.invite.ctx.place.library
on move.invite
when placeid=library
- Ask her to study with you here
- Offer to find her a good book

@rule move.invite.ctx.place.rooftop
on move.invite
when placeid=rooftop
- Ask her to stay and watch the view
- Suggest staying up here a little longer

@rule move.invite.ctx.wet
