when rainlater=yes
- Suggest heading home before it rains
- Offer to walk her home before the rain

@rule move.invite.ctx.outside
on move.invite
when outside=yes
- Suggest sitting on the bench for a bit
- Ask her to walk around with you

@rule move.invite.ctx.rainlover
on move.invite
when rainlover=yes wet=yes
- Ask her to listen to the rain with you
- Suggest watching the rain from the window

