- Offer to walk her to the {club}
- Ask if you can drop by the {club}

@rule move.invite.ctx.exam
on move.invite
when exam=yes
- Ask her to study for the exams together
- Offer to quiz her before the test

@rule move.invite.ctx.partner
on move.invite
