- Suggest hanging out with {partner} too
- Ask if {partner} would mind you joining them

@rule move.invite.ctx.days.many
on move.invite
when days=many
- Suggest making this a regular thing
- Ask her to meet up again tomorrow

@rule move.invite.ctx.interest
on move.invite
when interest=yes
- Ask her out properly
- Ask if she wants to go somewhere, just you two

@rule move.invite.ctx.favor.high
on move.invite
when favor>=80
- Ask her to spend the afternoon together
- Invite her somewhere special

@rule move.invite.ctx.lewd.high
on move.invite
when lewd>=60
- Suggest going somewhere quieter
- Ask if she wants to be alone with you

@rule move.invite.ctx.energy.high
on move.invite
when energy>=0.8
- Challenge her to a race
- Suggest doing something active

@rule move.invite.ctx.energy.low
on move.invite
when energy<=0.25
- Suggest just sitting together for a while
- Offer to get her a drink

