- Say you don't mind her being blunt
- Tell her you like her honesty

@rule move.comfort.ctx.favor.low
on move.comfort
when favor<=20
- Apologize if you bothered her
- Say you'll leave her be soon

@rule move.tease.ctx.tone.shy
